{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 102,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.37000274658203,
        90.68019104003906,
        218.4320526123047,
        103.59419250488281
      ],
      "text": "Box 2.4.2.1 PICO questions",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.40550231933594,
        119.32428741455078,
        509.047119140625,
        132.4692840576172
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Should LPAs be used to guide clinical decisions to use rifampicin in the direct",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        134.82427978515625,
        508.7235107421875,
        147.9692840576172
      ],
      "text": "testing of specimens and the indirect testing of culture isolates from patients with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970459938049316,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        150.32427978515625,
        312.5624084472656,
        163.4692840576172
      ],
      "text": "signs and symptoms consistent with TB?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.40550231933594,
        168.658935546875,
        508.9248046875,
        181.80393981933594
      ],
      "text": "2.\t  Should LPAs be used to guide clinical decisions to use isoniazid in the direct testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        184.158935546875,
        508.96014404296875,
        197.30393981933594
      ],
      "text": "of specimens and the indirect testing of culture isolates from patients with signs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        199.658935546875,
        285.3927001953125,
        212.80393981933594
      ],
      "text": "and symptoms consistent with TB?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.40550231933594,
        217.9935302734375,
        508.93707275390625,
        231.13853454589844
      ],
      "text": "3.\t Should LPAs be used to diagnose MDR-TB in patients with signs and symptoms",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        233.4935302734375,
        210.78050231933594,
        246.63853454589844
      ],
      "text": "consistent with TB?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.40550231933594,
        251.82818603515625,
        508.875244140625,
        264.97320556640625
      ],
      "text": "4.\t  Should LPAs be used to diagnose TB in patients with signs and symptoms consistent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        267.32818603515625,
        400.5065612792969,
        280.47320556640625
      ],
      "text": "with TB but for whom sputum-smear results are negative?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.17462158203125,
        526.59619140625,
        324.31964111328125
      ],
      "text": "Several studies contributed to either sensitivity (no true positives and no false negatives)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.67462158203125,
        527.1891479492188,
        339.81964111328125
      ],
      "text": "or specificity (no true negatives and no false positives) but not to both. For these studies,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.17462158203125,
        526.8709716796875,
        355.31964111328125
      ],
      "text": "a univariate, random-effects meta-analysis of the estimates of sensitivity or specificity was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.67462158203125,
        527.22314453125,
        370.81964111328125
      ],
      "text": "performed separately, to make optimal use of the data. The results from the univariate analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980833053588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.17462158203125,
        526.9370727539062,
        386.31964111328125
      ],
      "text": "(using all studies) were compared with the results from the bivariate analysis of the subset of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        388.67462158203125,
        415.4685974121094,
        401.81964111328125
      ],
      "text": "studies that contributed to estimates of both sensitivity and specificity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.6784973144531,
        526.9478149414062,
        425.8235168457031
      ],
      "text": "If there were at least four studies for index tests with data that contributed only to sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.1784973144531,
        527.1666259765625,
        441.3235168457031
      ],
      "text": "or specificity, a univariate, random-effects meta-analysis was performed to assess one summary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.965194702148438,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.6784973144531,
        526.966796875,
        456.8235168457031
      ],
      "text": "estimate, assuming no correlation between sensitivity and specificity. In cases in which there",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.1784973144531,
        526.9588623046875,
        472.3235168457031
      ],
      "text": "were fewer than four studies, or where substantial heterogeneity was evident on forest plots",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.6784973144531,
        527.0537109375,
        487.8235168457031
      ],
      "text": "that precluded a meta-analysis, a descriptive analysis was performed for these index tests. Forest",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.1784973144531,
        526.6920776367188,
        503.3235168457031
      ],
      "text": "plots were visually assessed for heterogeneity among the studies within each index test and in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993998527526855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.678466796875,
        526.9150390625,
        518.823486328125
      ],
      "text": "the summary plots, for variability in estimates and the width of the prediction region (a wider",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.178466796875,
        308.0342712402344,
        534.323486328125
      ],
      "text": "prediction region suggests more heterogeneity).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.6901245117188,
        275.1541442871094,
        563.0701293945312
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.821044921875,
        526.9722900390625,
        584.966064453125
      ],
      "text": "Adopting LPAs to detect rifampicin and isoniazid resistance does not eliminate the need for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.821044921875,
        527.00390625,
        598.966064453125
      ],
      "text": "conventional culture and DST capacity. Culture and phenotypic culture-based DST have critical",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98784351348877,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.821044921875,
        527.268310546875,
        612.966064453125
      ],
      "text": "roles in monitoring patients’ responses to treatment and detecting additional resistance to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.821044921875,
        165.71800231933594,
        626.966064453125
      ],
      "text": "second-line agents.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.572998046875,
        78.81909942626953,
        646.718017578125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        633.572998046875,
        526.9473876953125,
        646.718017578125
      ],
      "text": "The adoption of LPA should be phased in, starting at national or central reference laboratories,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        649.072998046875,
        526.8760375976562,
        662.218017578125
      ],
      "text": "or those with proven capability to conduct molecular testing. Expansion could be considered,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94576644897461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        664.572998046875,
        526.8304443359375,
        677.718017578125
      ],
      "text": "within the context of a country’s plans for laboratory strengthening, the availability of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        680.072998046875,
        508.75244140625,
        693.218017578125
      ],
      "text": "suitable personnel in peripheral centres and the quality of specimen transport systems.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.572998046875,
        78.81909942626953,
        708.718017578125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        695.572998046875,
        526.9861450195312,
        708.718017578125
      ],
      "text": "Adequate and appropriate laboratory infrastructure and equipment should be provided,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        711.072998046875,
        526.92041015625,
        724.218017578125
      ],
      "text": "to ensure that the required precautions for biosafety and the prevention of contamination",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        726.572998046875,
        526.9312133789062,
        739.718017578125
      ],
      "text": "are met – specimen processing for culture and procedures for manipulating cultures must",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        742.072998046875,
        447.769775390625,
        755.218017578125
      ],
      "text": "be performed in biological safety cabinets in TB-containment laboratories.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "86 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}